OL,3,GNEWSACompany boss died after NHS
OL,4,Aneglect, coroner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA psychiatric patient was frightened
OL,7,Finto taking his own life when a nurse
OL,8,Fsuggested he might be detained against
OL,9,Fhis will, a coroner has said.
OL,11,FJonny Doughty, 42, was found fatally
OL,12,Finjured at his home in Fair Oak,
OL,13,FHampshire, in August 2024.
OL,15,FThe company boss should have been given
OL,16,Fa hospital bed by Southern Health NHS
OL,17,FTrust, coroner Nicholas Walker said.
